    hintI18n: { "ja": "前文は当選、後文はガッツポーズを繰り返すので、空欄はこの喜びに合う表情の副詞を選んで動作を修飾します。", "en": "The first clause is winning and the second is repeatedly striking a victory pose, so pick a manner adverb of expression that matches this elation to modify the action." },
