    explanationI18n: { "ja": "「視線」は目線の向きを指し、「視線が自然と彼のほうへ向く」という文脈に合い、唯一成り立ちます。「視野」は見える範囲、「視力」は目がはっきり見える能力、「視察」は見て回ることで、三つとも「私の___が彼のほうへ」に入れると不自然です。", "en": "「視線」refers to the direction of one's gaze, fitting the context of \"my eyes turning toward him without my realizing,\" so it is the only fit.「視野」means field of view,「視力」means eyesight (the ability to see clearly), and「視察」means to inspect or tour — all three are unnatural when plugged into \"my ___ turned toward him.\"" },
